product image checker"/><meta property="og:type" content="website"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Pairvu Pricing for Product Image QA"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Compare Pairvu Free, Starter, Growth, and Agency plans for single and batch AI product image checks, CSV export, priority processing, and image retention."/><meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pairvu.com/opengraph-image"/><link rel="icon" href="/icon.svg?icon.1si4amm9w0f74.svg" sizes="any" type="image/svg+xml"/><script src="/_next/static/chunks/0cz1d0mv5g_q7.js" noModule=""></script></head><body><div hidden=""><!--$--><!--/$--></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","@id":"https://pairvu.com/#organization","name":"Pairvu","url":"https://pairvu.com","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https://pairvu.com/brand/pairvu-app-icon.png","width":512,"height":512},"description":"Pairvu is an AI product image checker that compares an AI-generated or edited product image against an original reference image."}</script><a class="skip-link" href="#main-content">Skip to content</a><header class="site-header"><div class="site-header-inner"><a class="site-logo" aria-label="Pairvu home" href="/">Pairvu</a><button aria-controls="site-menu-panel" aria-expanded="false" class="site-menu-toggle" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true" class="site-menu-icon"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span>Menu</span></button><div class="site-menu-panel" id="site-menu-panel"><nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation"><div class="site-nav-group"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="site-nav-trigger" type="button">Product</button><div class="site-nav-menu" hidden=""><a href="/how-pairvu-works">How Pairvu works</a><a href="/checks">Product checks</a><a href="/account/batches/new">Batch checking</a><a aria-current="page" href="/pricing">Pricing</a></div></div><div class="site-nav-group"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="site-nav-trigger" type="button">Learn</button><div class="site-nav-menu" hidden=""><a href="/ai-product-photography">AI product photography</a><a href="/examples">Comparison examples</a><a href="/guides">Guides</a></div></div><div class="site-nav-group"><button aria-expanded="false" aria-haspopup="true" class="site-nav-trigger" type="button">Solutions</button><div class="site-nav-menu" hidden=""><a href="/categories">Product categories</a><a href="/use-cases">Use cases</a></div></div></nav><div class="header-actions"><a class="header-account-link" aria-busy="true" href="/account">Account</a><a class="header-cta" href="/#checker">Check image</a></div></div></div></header><div id="main-content"><main class="content-page"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","@id":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#service","name":"Pairvu product image QA","description":"Compare Pairvu Free, Starter, Growth, and Agency plans for single and batch AI product image checks, CSV export, priority processing, and image retention.","serviceType":"AI product image quality assurance","provider":{"@id":"https://pairvu.com/#organization"},"areaServed":"Worldwide","offers":[{"@type":"Offer","name":"Free plan","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#free","price":"0.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"Monthly SaaS subscription","description":"10 product checks per month and 7-day image retention"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Starter plan","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#starter","price":"19.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"Monthly SaaS subscription","description":"150 product checks per month and 30-day image retention"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Growth plan","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#growth","price":"49.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"Monthly SaaS subscription","description":"600 product checks per month and 30-day image retention"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"Agency plan","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#agency","price":"99.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"Monthly SaaS subscription","description":"1500 product checks per month and 30-day image retention"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"50-check pack","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#pack_50","price":"9.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"One-time check pack","description":"50 product checks valid for 365 days"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"200-check pack","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#pack_200","price":"29.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"One-time check pack","description":"200 product checks valid for 365 days"},{"@type":"Offer","name":"500-check pack","url":"https://pairvu.com/pricing#pack_500","price":"59.00","priceCurrency":"USD","category":"One-time check pack","description":"500 product checks valid for 365 days"}]}</script><div class="content-container"><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://pairvu.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Pricing","item":"https://pairvu.com/pricing"}]}</script><nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li><span>Pricing</span></li></ol></nav><header class="content-hero content-hero-compact"><p class="eyebrow">Public paid beta</p><h1>Pairvu Pricing</h1><p class="content-deck">Start free, then choose the monthly capacity that fits your product-image workflow. No invitation is required. Paid plans include batch checking, CSV export, and 30-day image retention.</p><div class="content-actions"><a class="primary-link-button" href="/account">Open your workspace</a><a class="text-link" href="/#checker">Try one image pair</a></div></header><section class="pricing-grid" aria-label="Pairvu plans"><article class="pricing-plan" id="free"><div><p class="eyebrow">Free plan</p><h2>Free</h2><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->0</strong><span>/month</span></p><p>Try Pairvu and keep a small monthly review workflow.</p></div><ul><li>10<!-- --> checks each month</li><li>Up to <!-- -->5<!-- --> images in one batch</li><li>Result review in your workspace</li><li>Standard processing</li><li>7<!-- -->-day image retention</li></ul><a class="secondary-link-button" href="/account">Start free</a></article><article class="pricing-plan pricing-plan-featured" id="starter"><div><p class="eyebrow">Popular starting point</p><h2>Starter</h2><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->19</strong><span>/month</span></p><p>For regular product-image review and small batches.</p></div><ul><li>150<!-- --> checks each month</li><li>Up to <!-- -->20<!-- --> images in one batch</li><li>CSV export included</li><li>Standard processing</li><li>30<!-- -->-day image retention</li></ul><div class="pricing-plan-action"><button class="primary-link-button" type="button">Choose Starter</button></div></article><article class="pricing-plan" id="growth"><div><p class="eyebrow">Growth plan</p><h2>Growth</h2><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->49</strong><span>/month</span></p><p>For growing content operations that need more checks and priority processing.</p></div><ul><li>600<!-- --> checks each month</li><li>Up to <!-- -->20<!-- --> images in one batch</li><li>CSV export included</li><li>Priority batch processing</li><li>30<!-- -->-day image retention</li></ul><div class="pricing-plan-action"><button class="primary-link-button" type="button">Choose Growth</button></div></article><article class="pricing-plan" id="agency"><div><p class="eyebrow">Agency plan</p><h2>Agency</h2><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->99</strong><span>/month</span></p><p>For high-volume client work across repeated product-image reviews.</p></div><ul><li>1500<!-- --> checks each month</li><li>Up to <!-- -->20<!-- --> images in one batch</li><li>CSV export included</li><li>Priority batch processing</li><li>30<!-- -->-day image retention</li></ul><div class="pricing-plan-action"><button class="primary-link-button" type="button">Choose Agency</button></div></article></section><section class="article-section" id="check-packs" aria-labelledby="check-packs-title"><p class="eyebrow">One-time capacity</p><h2 id="check-packs-title">Buy extra checks without changing your plan</h2><p>Check packs are one-time purchases for occasional spikes. They can be used with Free or paid workspaces, remain available across monthly renewals for 365 days, and are consumed only after monthly checks run out. A pack adds checks only; plan features and image retention still follow your current plan.</p><div class="pricing-pack-grid" aria-label="One-time check packs"><article class="pricing-pack" id="pack_50"><p class="eyebrow">One-time purchase</p><h3>50<!-- --> checks</h3><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->9</strong><span> once</span></p><ul><li>Valid for <!-- -->365<!-- --> days</li><li>Used after monthly checks</li><li>No automatic overage charges</li></ul><div class="pricing-plan-action"><button class="primary-link-button" type="button">Buy check pack</button></div></article><article class="pricing-pack" id="pack_200"><p class="eyebrow">One-time purchase</p><h3>200<!-- --> checks</h3><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->29</strong><span> once</span></p><ul><li>Valid for <!-- -->365<!-- --> days</li><li>Used after monthly checks</li><li>No automatic overage charges</li></ul><div class="pricing-plan-action"><button class="primary-link-button" type="button">Buy check pack</button></div></article><article class="pricing-pack" id="pack_500"><p class="eyebrow">One-time purchase</p><h3>500<!-- --> checks</h3><p class="pricing-price"><strong>$<!-- -->59</strong><span> once</span></p><ul><li>Valid for <!-- -->365<!-- --> days</li><li>Used after monthly checks</li><li>No automatic overage charges</li></ul><div class="pricing-plan-action"><button class="primary-link-button" type="button">Buy check pack</button></div></article></div></section><section class="article-section" aria-labelledby="billing-details"><h2 id="billing-details">How billing and checks work</h2><div class="decision-table-wrap"><table class="decision-table"><thead><tr><th>Policy</th><th>What to expect</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Monthly allowance</td><td>Included checks reset each billing period and do not carry forward.</td></tr><tr><td>Extra check packs</td><td>One-time packs remain separate from monthly checks, last for 365 days, and are used only after the monthly allowance.</td></tr><tr><td>Completed checks</td><td>A check is charged only after Pairvu returns PASS, REVIEW, or FAIL. Provider and system failures are not charged.</td></tr><tr><td>Image retention</td><td>Free images are retained for 7 days. Paid-plan images and analysis derivatives are retained for 30 days.</td></tr><tr><td>Billing management</td><td>Stripe handles payment details, invoices, and cancellation through its secure billing portal.</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="article-section" aria-labelledby="beta-boundaries"><h2 id="beta-boundaries">Public beta boundaries</h2><p>These are introductory public-beta plans. A batch currently supports at most 20 candidates, and plan switching is handled securely through Stripe after a subscription starts. Pairvu provides visible product QA, not marketplace certification, regulatory approval, or an enterprise service-level agreement.</p></section><section class="article-section" aria-labelledby="pricing-faq"><h2 id="pricing-faq">Pricing questions</h2><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Do I need an invitation?</summary><p>No. Create an account, use the Free plan, or choose a paid plan here. If you are signed out, Pairvu asks you to sign in before opening Stripe Checkout.</p></details><details><summary>Do the 10 Free checks add to a paid plan?</summary><p>No. Upgrading replaces the Free monthly allowance with the paid plan allowance for the active billing period.</p></details><details><summary>Can I cancel?</summary><p>Yes. Open Manage billing in your workspace to cancel through Stripe. Access follows the subscription state shown in your account.</p></details><details><summary>Can I buy checks without a subscription?</summary><p>Yes. A one-time check pack works on a Free workspace and does not start a subscription. It adds checks only, so retention and workflow features continue to follow the current plan.</p></details><details><summary>What happens when an image expires?</summary><p>The retained image and derivatives stop restoring. Result metadata may remain available so the decision is still auditable.</p></details></div></section><section class="article-section article-cta"><h2>Check product images before publishing</h2><p>Use one approved reference with a single candidate or review up to 20 candidate images in a paid batch.</p><div class="content-actions"><a class="primary-link-button" href="/account">Create your workspace</a><a class="text-link" href="/how-pairvu-works">See how Pairvu works</a></div></section><p class="content-updated">Last updated: August 19, 2026</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--></div><footer class="site-footer"><div class="site-footer-inner"><div class="footer-brand"><a class="site-logo" href="/"><svg aria-hidden="true" class="site-logo-art" viewBox="0 0 236 72" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><defs><linearGradient id="pairvu-brand-gradient" x1="0" x2="1" y1="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#2f80ff"></stop><stop offset="1" stop-color="#7a4dff"></stop></linearGradient></defs><g fill="none" stroke="url(#pairvu-brand-gradient)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="5" y="19" width="28" height="29" rx="6" stroke-width="5"></rect><path d="m9 42 8-8 7 7 4-4 5 5" stroke-width="4"></path><rect x="39" y="19" width="28" height="29" rx="6" stroke-width="5"></rect><path d="m43 42 8-8 7 7 4-4 5 5" stroke-width="4"></path><circle cx="36" cy="34" r="11" fill="#0b133f" stroke-width="5"></circle><circle cx="36" cy="34" r="3" fill="url(#pairvu-brand-gradi